      "releaseNotes": "• De nouveaux réticules ont été ajoutés : \n - Artelv AM6-6x, CRS 1-6x24 SFP\n - Bushnell Dot Drop, Trophy Quick Acquisition 1-6х24\n - Discovery SS MIL, VT-Z 4-16×50 SF FFP\n - Hikmicro #7, Alpex A50T\n - InfiRay R6, BOLT TH50C V2\n - Marcool MAR-170, EVV 6-24X50 SF FFP\n - Sig Sauer HellFire Ballistic Hunter BDC, CANYON4 4-16x44\n - Vector Optics VOW-MOA, Matiz 2-7x32\n - Vortex XBR-2 (MOA), Crossfire II 2-7x32 Crossbow",
